{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"185b33206ae346e5","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":900,"height":50,"text":"# 一轮打标关键流程"},
		{"id":"40e8448708114485","type":"text","x":0,"y":55,"width":980,"height":40,"text":"web 路径；CLI 路径同构，无 HTTP 环节"},
		{"id":"655a7740e1544ee8","type":"text","x":320,"y":110,"width":340,"height":110,"color":"#64748b","text":"**素材导入**\n\n图片 jpg/jpeg/png/webp/gif\n视频 mp4/mov/webm/avi/mkv/m4v"},
		{"id":"7b2c143cbed0461c","type":"text","x":320,"y":250,"width":340,"height":110,"color":"#3b82f6","text":"**登记 imports.jsonl**\n\n哈希 / 相对路径 / 白名单状态\n复制导入（源文件不动）或就地采用"},
		{"id":"92d393f4ba954625","type":"text","x":320,"y":390,"width":340,"height":110,"color":"#d97706","text":"◇ **白名单与大小护栏？**\n\n图片≤20MB · 视频≤100MB\n平铺不递归"},
		{"id":"7b51943fe07b4532","type":"text","x":20,"y":405,"width":260,"height":90,"color":"#ef4444","text":"**拒绝并登记原因**（不入批次）"},
		{"id":"523d3f141006496a","type":"text","x":320,"y":530,"width":340,"height":110,"color":"#3b82f6","text":"**建批：策略 × 工作目录**\n\n两来源：素材组 / 工作目录\n配对冲突默认入包"},
		{"id":"00f4c096309d4682","type":"text","x":320,"y":670,"width":340,"height":110,"color":"#3b82f6","text":"**应用库策略生成快照 sN.json**\n\n自包含冻结、可跨目录复用\n手改/损坏可发现，旧快照不报错"},
		{"id":"ca521ffa8beb4c01","type":"text","x":320,"y":810,"width":340,"height":110,"color":"#3b82f6","text":"**串行流式跑批**\n\n占用锁并发拒绝 · 排队中可覆盖发车\n停止两档：已完成保留 / 已中断停因，可续跑"},
		{"id":"bb08ce2821be4366","type":"text","x":320,"y":950,"width":340,"height":90,"color":"#d97706","text":"◇ **哈希命中已完成？**"},
		{"id":"a11a110032674e32","type":"text","x":320,"y":1070,"width":340,"height":110,"color":"#3b82f6","text":"**调 llm 能力层**\n\nSSE start/delta/done · 六分组监控\n视频取首帧 · 思考不入产物"},
		{"id":"2234e0feea7c4532","type":"text","x":20,"y":1085,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"#d97706","text":"**退避重试**\n\n429 遵循 Retry-After\n1/2/4s+抖动，最多 3 次"},
		{"id":"7676729fa4ca4183","type":"text","x":320,"y":1210,"width":340,"height":90,"color":"#d97706","text":"◇ **结果分类**\n\n可重试？"},
		{"id":"3d71acad49fb4acb","type":"text","x":320,"y":1330,"width":340,"height":90,"color":"#16a34a","text":"**写产物 sN__主干.txt**\n\n与 items.jsonl"},
		{"id":"6b454f43d3b44e58","type":"text","x":760,"y":1335,"width":380,"height":90,"color":"#ef4444","text":"**入失败分组**（停止仍保留产物）\n\n失败入常驻重试列表，跨会话持久"},
		{"id":"23196a82fc6b4ab2","type":"text","x":320,"y":1450,"width":340,"height":90,"color":"#d97706","text":"◇ **还有条目？**"},
		{"id":"5f4a50aff4444e45","type":"text","x":320,"y":1570,"width":340,"height":110,"color":"#3b82f6","text":"**生成打包计划**\n\n入包资格判定 · 将入包/被排除两清单逐条列原因\n打包前完整性哈希校验"},
		{"id":"818426b02b3946f2","type":"text","x":320,"y":1710,"width":340,"height":110,"color":"#16a34a","text":"**zip 平铺导出**\n\n001 三位定宽图文配对\n非 ASCII 重命名 · 无 manifest · 凭据不入包"},
		{"id":"b08ceb802e25417e","type":"text","x":320,"y":1850,"width":340,"height":70,"color":"#64748b","text":"**导出包交付**"},
		{"id":"b0d88c6f8a5e4bbb","type":"group","x":760,"y":230,"width":420,"height":305,"color":"#8b5cf6","label":"工作目录维护链（不进打标主流程）"},
		{"id":"47224e2079054346","type":"text","x":780,"y":280,"width":380,"height":50,"text":"清理派生物：三类并集任务化，完成后真删"},
		{"id":"8e5ea9010db74e07","type":"text","x":780,"y":340,"width":380,"height":50,"text":"未导入文件：一键导入 / 直接永久删除"},
		{"id":"3e51cade6c8a4560","type":"text","x":780,"y":400,"width":380,"height":50,"text":"删批次连带运行记录 → quarantine 可恢复"},
		{"id":"fbb5617ebdff479b","type":"text","x":780,"y":460,"width":380,"height":50,"text":"目录迁移：前后端同锁、目标空分层校验、三态"},
		{"id":"25344676d2894ae7","type":"group","x":760,"y":555,"width":420,"height":240,"color":"#64748b","label":"库源（应用时复制入快照）"},
		{"id":"8fad117495ae43f7","type":"text","x":780,"y":605,"width":380,"height":50,"text":"提示词库 prompts"},
		{"id":"42e70639c2074317","type":"text","x":780,"y":665,"width":380,"height":50,"text":"技能包 skills"},
		{"id":"265b21bd6fe84058","type":"text","x":780,"y":725,"width":380,"height":50,"text":"端点配置 endpoints"},
		{"id":"e3d2ef069d5c4ffa","type":"text","x":0,"y":1960,"width":900,"height":30,"text":"复刻自 Dataset Factory 协作仓 asset/docs/key-flow.svg"}
	],
